# Moonshot 7 — phext.tech

Coordinate: 30.7.9/10.7.11/9.8.10
Number: 7 (permanent; migration never renumbers)

The platform on phext.tech, three components: Scroll Space (traversal and reading), Phext Edit (writing), and KGOAT — the Knowledge Graph Of All Things, a layer-two phext format (worker ⇒ phext-lattice, warrior ⇒ tluf, religious ⇒ scrollspace). Per ruling D4, phext.tech is a direct upgrade of edit.phext.io. The submitted project of record for the No Excuses Fund is The Exocortex of 2130 (ruling D1). KGOAT's axioms are Will's words: 'KGOAT organizes everything you enter holographically.' 'KGOAT doesn't require you to understand the tech, it just works.'

Inception / designation evidence:
- Will's product decision, 2026-11-21 15:13 CST (PH: Revenue): phext.tech launches with Scroll Space, Phext Edit, and the knowledge-graph layer. Will registered phext.tech himself via NFSN the same day.
- KGOAT named by Will 2026-11-21 15:14 CST; repo wbic16/kgoat created by Will; component ruling 15:43 CST; design decisions D1–D6 ruled 15:46–15:47 CST (register #216 closed).

